        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sherwood Stewart, Ekaterina Makarova, Nduka Odizor, Van Winitsky, Steve Denton, Petra Kvitová\n- Events: 1983 Dallas Open – Doubles, 2011 Aegon International – Women's Singles\n- Places: Goose Creek, Texas, United States\n- Topics: Tennis\n\nFacts:\n- Sherwood Stewart was born on June 6, 1946, in Goose Creek, Texas, United States.\n- Sherwood Stewart played amateur and professional tennis in the 1970s and 1980s.\n- In the 1983 Dallas Open – Doubles final, Nduka Odizor and Van Winitsky defeated Steve Denton and Sherwood Stewart 6–3, 7–5.\n- Ekaterina Valeryevna Makarova was born on June 7, 1988, and is a Russian professional tennis player.\n- Ekaterina Makarova was the defending champion at the 2011 Aegon International – Women's Singles, but Petra Kvitová defeated her in the second round.",
